", "summary": "RaidCast is a fantasy strategy game for streamers and their viewers. Viewers type !join in Twitch, Kick or YouTube chat, and their heroes and troops march into the streamer's battle \u2014 a single Campaign fight can hold thousands of soldiers. Between streams each player rebuilds a fortified coastal town, raises a hero and a squad of shieldbearers, spearmen, archers and healers, forges equipment, learns hero skills and heals the wounded.\n\nBattles are automatic: players prepare the hero and the army, and the troops fight on their own. Campaign is played on stream together with the streamer; Raids are played solo, as a duo or as a trio; the World Boss is a stream event where up to 30 heroes fight one giant enemy. Players also trade on the market, send caravans and join guilds.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 39, "name": "Warfare"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/raidcast", "videos": [{"id": 204640, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "PmAFUz5NXfg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PmAFUz5NXfg", "title": "RaidCast \u2014 Your Chat. Your Army. | Now on Unity", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/PmAFUz5NXfg/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}